      <slide>
        <title>Exercise 3a: </title>
        <p>
            Find and report the draft number assigned to your birthday.
        </p>
      </slide>
      <slide>
        <title>Exercise 3b: </title>
        <p>
            Is your draft number in the bottom third (1–122), middle third (123–244), or top third (245–366)?
        </p>
      </slide>
